只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"中文","id":"gh:1333912019","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-codex-tools","slug":"SPYQWER1/dsh-codex-tools","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"# dsh-codex-tools"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness plugin that registers three tools provided by ChatGPT Codex:"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"| Tool | Function |"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| `codex_web_search` | Searches the public web and returns a summary with source URLs. |\n| `image_ge"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"n` | Generates a bitmap image. It does not edit or transform an existing image. |\n| `image_vision` |"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" Reads a local image and returns a description or an answer to a question about it. |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"It consumes an existing Codex/ChatGPT login; it does not provide login or an LLM provider."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Runtime requirements"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness.\n- A ChatGPT/Codex login state, either `codex login` with an auth file, or creden"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"tials in DSH:\n- `OPENAI_CODEX_API_KEY`\n- `OPENAI_CODEX_REFRESH_TOKEN`"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Credentials are resolved from `CODEX_ACCESS_TOKEN` and `CODEX_REFRESH_TOKEN` environment variables f"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"irst (the plugin maps the DSH credential names above to these variables). If those are absent, the t"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ransport reads `$CODEX_HOME/auth.json` when `CODEX_HOME` is set, or `~/.codex/auth.json` otherwise. "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"Set `CODEX_HOME` to choose another auth directory; the default is `~/.codex`. After an HTTP 401, a t"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"ransport refreshes the access token once and attempts to persist the refreshed login state to that a"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"uth file. When the plugin injects DSH credentials, the refresh code may still write to the auth file"},{"id":"p9s7","text":" selected by `CODEX_HOME` or the default path."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Restart after installation (`dsh web` or `dsh --profile web`).\nRemove it with `dsh plugin --profile "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"web remove dsh-codex-tools`."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Image generation"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Image vision"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Tool parameters"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### `codex_web_search`"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Parameter | Type | Default / limits |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| `query` | string (required) | Public-web research question. |\n| `maxSources` | integer | `5`; from"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" 1 to 10. |\n| `freshness` | string | `cached`, or `live` for time-sensitive queries. |\n| `model` | s"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"tring | `gpt-5.4-mini`. |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The result contains `summary` and `sources`; each source has a title, URL, and snippet."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### `image_gen`"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Parameter | Type | Default / limits |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| `prompt` | string (required) | Describe the subject, style, composition, palette, and constraints."},{"id":"p23s2","text":" |\n| `out` | string | `output/imagegen/<timestamp>.<format>`; must be relative to the current DSH se"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ssion workspace. The workspace root comes from DSH's sandbox-policy service. Absolute paths, parent-"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"directory segments, and symbolic links are rejected. Parent directories are created, and existing fi"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"les are never overwritten. If `out` is omitted, the extension follows `format`. |\n| `size` | string "},{"id":"p23s6","text":"| `auto`, `1024x1024`, `1536x1024`, `1024x1536`, `2048x2048`, or `2048x1152`. |\n| `format` | string "},{"id":"p23s7","text":"| `png`, `jpeg`, or `webp`; default `png`. |\n| `model` | string | `gpt-5.5`. |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### `image_vision`"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Parameter | Type | Default / limits |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| `image` | string (required) | Existing `png`, `jpeg/jpg`, `webp`, or `gif` under the current DSH s"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ession workspace; absolute paths, parent-directory segments, and symbolic links are rejected. Maximu"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"m 15 MiB. |\n| `question` | string | Optional focus question; omitted means a full description. |\n| `"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"model` | string | `gpt-5.5`. |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The transport reads the local file, embeds it in the request, and sends it to the ChatGPT Codex endp"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"oint. Only files inside the transport workspace are accepted."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Caveats and service terms"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- `chatgpt.com/backend-api/codex/responses` is an internal endpoint used by the official Codex CLI, "},{"id":"p31s2","text":"not a documented public API. It may change or be restricted without notice.\n- Search summaries and s"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"nippets are model-generated; open the returned source URLs and check the original text before relyin"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"g on them.\n- Web search and image generation use the metered **Codex-usage** bucket of the ChatGPT p"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"lan.\n- Follow OpenAI's Terms of Use; do not use a ChatGPT subscription to power a public-facing imag"},{"id":"p31s6","text":"e-generation service."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"MIT — see LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
